{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列人背弃上帝"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华对我说：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你去向耶路撒冷宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘耶和华说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我记得你们年轻时对我的忠贞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"爱我如新娘爱新郎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"跟随我穿越旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穿越不毛之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列是耶和华的圣民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是属于祂的初熟果子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞吃它的必担当罪责，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大祸临头。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["雅各家啊，以色列家啊！你们要听耶和华的话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和华说：",{"text":"“你们的祖先在我身上找到什么过错，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他们远离我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去追随虚妄的神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己也变得虚妄呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们从不问，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘耶和华曾带我们出埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"引导我们走过沙漠纵横、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"深坑满布、干旱幽暗、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"杳无人迹的旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂如今在哪里呢？’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我带领你们进入肥沃之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"享受那里的果子及丰富物产。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你们进来玷污我的土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我的产业成为可憎之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众祭司从来不问，‘耶和华在哪里？’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"传授律法的不认识我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首领背叛我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知靠巴力说预言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"随从无用的偶像。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要指控你们和你们的子孙后代。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们去对岸的基提看看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"派人去基达仔细观察一下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看有没有这样的事？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然列国的神明根本不是真神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却没有一国更换自己的神明。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的子民却把自己荣耀的上帝换作了无用的偶像。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"诸天啊，要因此而震惊、战栗、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大感凄凉。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我的子民犯了两项罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们离弃了我这活水源泉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为自己挖了不能蓄水的破池子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"“以色列是奴隶吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是生来为奴的吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么他竟成了猎物呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敌人像狮子般向他咆哮吼叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他的土地一片荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的城邑一片废墟，杳无人烟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪弗人和答比匿人打破了你的头颅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这不是自食其果吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你的上帝耶和华一路引导你的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你却背弃祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在，你去埃及喝尼罗河的水有什么好处呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你去亚述喝幼发拉底河的水有什么好处呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必因自己的罪恶而受惩罚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因自己的背叛而受责备。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，你要省察且明白，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背弃你的上帝耶和华、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不敬畏我，是多么邪恶、痛苦的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主——万军之耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"“很久以前，我折断你的轭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挣开你的捆索，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你却拒绝事奉我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在各高岗上、绿树下躺卧淫乱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你原本是我栽种的上等葡萄树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是上好的品种。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎么自甘堕落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"变成了野葡萄？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"纵然你用碱和许多肥皂清洗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在我面前仍然罪迹斑斑。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"“你怎能说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我没有玷污自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有随从巴力’？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看你在山谷中的行径，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"想想你的所作所为。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是一只烦躁不安的母骆驼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"跑来跑去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是一只习惯在旷野生活的野驴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求偶心切时便呼呼喘气，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"发情时谁也控制不了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公驴找你不费工夫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你发情的时候很容易找到你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我说，‘不要因追随假神而跑破鞋子，喉咙干渴。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你却说，‘不行！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我爱外族的神明，一定要跟随它们。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"text":"“以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们与你们的君王、官长、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司和先知必蒙羞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同被擒的盗贼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们认木头为父，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"认石头为生母。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不是面向我而是背对我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"危难时却向我求救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们为自己造的神明在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"危难时让它们救你们吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“犹大人啊，你们神明的数目与你们的城邑一样多！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"text":"“你们为什么指控我呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们都背叛了我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我责打你们的儿女，却是徒劳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们不受管教。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们杀害你们的先知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"残暴如狮子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这世代的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要留心听耶和华的话。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对以色列人来说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道我是旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是幽暗之地吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么我的子民竟说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我们可以四处游荡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再追随你’？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女会忘记她的首饰吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新娘会忘记她的礼服吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民却早已把我忘记，绵绵无期。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"text":"“你们真善于求爱啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至把技巧教给妓女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的衣服沾满无辜穷人的血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们并没有抓到他们进屋偷窃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然这样，你们还说，‘我们是无辜的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华不再向我们发怒。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我必审判你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们拒不认罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们为什么这样忽东忽西地变来变去呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们投奔埃及必蒙羞辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像从前投奔亚述一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必抱愧蒙羞地离开埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华弃绝了你们的靠山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们从他们那里必得不到帮助。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":37}